<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-July budget deficit falls to SKK6.09bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-July budget deficit falls to SKK6.09bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak state budget deficit for the January-July period narrowed to 6.09 billion crowns from a 6.13 billion crown deficit in the January-June period, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK STATE BUDGET   Jan-July    Jan-June   1996 est</p>
<p>  Revenues (SKK bln)    95.853	79.525	162.425</p>
<p>  Expenditure	    101.941	85.654	189.425</p>
<p>  Balance		   -6.088	-6.129	-27.000</p>
<p>Note: 1996 estimate based on the government's budget plan which was passed by Parliament.</p>
<p>-- Tatiana Vacova, Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
